WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome, welcome
back to the show.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
What a week you've had, huh?
-Oh, man.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.738 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Has it been emotional?

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:06.272 line:92%
-Yeah. It's been a little bit

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
of every emotion
that's inside of my body.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:13.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
Emotions I didn't know I had,
they've been coming out.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
But in silence, though.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.784 line:92%
I've been keeping it together.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:18.685 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, exactly.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've gotten so much love
on Twitter.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:25.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
I saw that Barack Obama
tweeted at you.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:26.292 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.427 line:92%
-How does that make you feel?

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.963
I mean, do you think back
of when you were a kid

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
and be like, "I can't believe
the president --

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
a president
is gonna tweet at me"?

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.037
A tweet, you wouldn't even know
what that is, yeah, I guess.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.339 line:92%
-I'm at my final game in Miami,

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.074
and they had all these tributes
to me.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:44.277
And the first one that comes up
when the game started

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.178 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
is Barack Obama.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:45.945 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And it wasn't just

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:48.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
a "Congratulations, Dwyane"
message.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.482 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It was a long message.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"He really took time."

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He took some time to give
a real thing for you.

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just amazing,
but I was like --

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think about, you know,
everyone's career

00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:00.126
when you're first starting out,
and you're in high school,

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.929 size:88% position:44%
and you don't even know
if you're gonna make it.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Especially me.
I know I do.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, well, you kind of did
a little bit,

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:08.268 size:78% position:39% line:92%
because I found this.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a --
This was in the local paper

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.604 line:92%
when you were in high school.

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's you, right?
-Yeah.

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:13.807 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-And this is your quote.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.242 size:81% position:41%
It said, "I see myself
retiring from the NBA

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
to spend time
with my wife and kids,

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:21.314
also retiring as one of
the greatest to play the game."

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:24.384 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:24.784 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow!

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Positive.
Hey, speak it into existence.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:30.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean...
you're kind of doing that.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.459 line:92%
-So, the crazy thing about that

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:35.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
is, at that time,
I was 17 years old.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.262 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That was 1999.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.866 size:84% position:42%
So today as I sit here,
it's obviously 2019.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.433 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm 37 years old.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was actually
20 years ago exactly.

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it's crazy.
-To the day.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:48.875
That's -- Does it feel good
going out on your terms?

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:49.542 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You know, it does.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.377 size:84% position:42%
You know, in this sport
and sports, period --

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.446 size:81% position:41%
well, in any career --
sometimes, you know,

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
they might push you out
a little bit,

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.217
give you a little nudge,
you know, when it's time.

00:01:57.217 --> 00:02:01.488
But for me to be able to,
you know, come to this decision

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
and say that this is
the time for me

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.325 size:81% position:41%
and to be able to have
the season that I had

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:07.894 size:81% position:41%
where everybody like,
"You got another year,

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:08.728 line:92%
you got another two years,"

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was exactly what
I wanted everybody saying,

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
instead of, like --
You know, I told Coach this.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
I never wanted my coach
to be like --

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
to look past me on the bench,
you know?

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, like --
-"Oh, yeah, you're here, too."

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, like, "Aw, man,
we got to put somebody in."

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.276 line:92%
-"We got to throw him a bone."

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:26.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. So before that,
I was like, "Yo, I'm out."

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You never want
to experience that.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.682 size:84% position:42% line:92%
On your last home game,

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:32.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
you fell into the crowd
after doing a fadeaway shot.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:36.222
And you fell into two of the
most famous people on earth --

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.824 line:92%
John Legend and Chrissy Teigen.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this is one
of the best photos.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.661 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:46.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughing ] Look at John's --
Look at John's face.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:48.201 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at his face.

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:50.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For all the kids out there.
-Yeah.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:54.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Look at the focus, okay?
I ain't worried about nothing.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.308 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I am focused.

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:58.411
Look at the follow-through.
-There's beer in the air.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:00.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Luckily --
I'll say this for John.

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
Lucky that we're friends,
first of all.

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:03.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
lucky that we're friends.

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:06.085
But I do owe them some vodka
and all that that was spilled.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.687
-Whatever was spilled out there,
yeah.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Whatever spilled on my back,
I owe that to them.

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:12.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you didn't do that
on purpose, right?

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.293 line:92%
-I didn't do that on purpose.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:14.093 line:92%
I had shot, like, you know,

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:15.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
a little fadeaway shot
in that corner.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the ball had --
It went in and out,

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I was really focused
and looking.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:21.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when I turned around,
I seen who it was,

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:23.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"Oh, my goodness."

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.103 line:92%
I couldn't believe it was them.

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:26.906
-Now it's a meme, but it's
perfect in your last game.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:29.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, my wife --
You see my wife over there.

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:30.410 size:88% position:44% line:92%
She's, like, grabbing me

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
but looking at the rim
at the same time.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is that her there?
-Yeah.

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:35.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's still looking
at the shot, too.

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
She's focused, too!

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:39.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You see her?
-She's just as focused. See?

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're focused.
-That's why --

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:42.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what a real --
couple goals.

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:43.923 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Goals.

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.659 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:48.895 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What's next?

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:52.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know you're a businessman,
an entrepreneur, as well,

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.299 size:88% position:44% line:92%
but, I mean, do we know?

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:55.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, getting over
this hangover is what's next.

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:59.606
I've never been hungover before.
I'm 37.

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:01.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is my first hangover,
and it sucks.

00:04:01.808 --> 00:04:03.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm pulling it together
right now,

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:05.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
but inside, I am sweating
underneath here.

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:06.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:09.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, it's terrible.
-You celebrated last night?

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:12.185
-I've been celebrating
and celebrating and celebrating.

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:15.922
I still got my game shoes on,
I've been celebrating so much.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:16.856 line:92%
I didn't even take them off.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm honored to be
your first hangover.

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:19.993 size:88% position:44% line:92%
This is an honor for me.

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:22.929
I just want to thank you
on behalf of all your fans

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:23.730 line:92%
for everything you've done.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.899
And whatever is next, come back
on the show and talk about it.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you. I appreciate it.
-Congratulations.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We love you, dude.
-Thank you.

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.639 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Dwyane Wade, everybody!

